# Editing this file starts the "Set up and ingest" workflow.
#
# It exists because the workflow could not otherwise be started by anything that
# can only push commits: API dispatch and tag pushes are both refused to some
# integrations, while a commit is not. Change the line below — the value is
# irrelevant, the change is the signal — and push.
#
# Runs use the workflow's defaults: the starter universe from 2016-01-01, then
# EDGAR fundamentals. For anything else, use Actions → Set up and ingest → Run
# workflow, which takes parameters.

run: 2 — retry with batched inserts, after the first run timed out on latency
